# Route: guide 36 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 53 to 55, 26
# quests, 4.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Winterspring): Frostfire Hot Springs -> Winterfall Village ->
# Frostfire Hot Springs -> Everlook -> Frostfire Hot Springs -> Timbermaw Post
# -> Frostfire Hot Springs -> Starfall Village -> Lake Kel'Theril -> Everlook
# -> Ice Thistle Hills -> Everlook -> Ice Thistle Hills -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5124 Fiery
# Plate Gauntlets; 5127 The Demon Forge; 5305 Sweet Serenity; 5306 Snakestone
# of the Shadow Huntress; 5307 Corruption; 8798 A Yeti of Your Own.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Drakefire Amulet (6502).

